  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DoctorHelp.NpcDialogueAsset
  content: "Hello, doctor. I feel hot and sick, and my arm hurts after a fall.\nI think the stairs turned when I asked what time it was.\nI've no idea what came over me. I just need somewhere to sit."
